8. Release Governance Expectations

Include a short section stating the expected release practice:

* Generate the report for the correct team and Fix Version.
* Review every applicable violation and readiness issue.
* Fix genuine violations and resolve outstanding story, branch-cut, and deployment items.
* Request overrides only for justified false positives.
* Ensure overrides receive the required admin approval.
* Re-run or refresh the report as appropriate and verify that outstanding violations have been resolved.

The target is zero unresolved applicable violations before release, along with completion of the required readiness activities. Do not imply that exclusions or overrides automatically mean an underlying issue has been fixed.

